  revert i
  exact forall_fin6 (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_0 j) (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_1 j) (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_2 j) (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_3 j) (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_4 j) (Z0_4_4Raw_sound_5 j)
